# The in-OS Rust toolchain tarballs Step 3.5 of the image scripts downloads
# from static.rust-lang.org, pinned by sha256 (#33). Both scripts verify a
# download against this file and never against a checksum fetched beside it.
# The hashes are the `xz_hash` values of the signed channel manifest,
# https://static.rust-lang.org/dist/channel-rust-1.98.1.toml (2026-10-24).
# When RUST_TOOLCHAIN_VERSION moves, add the new version's three lines.
2ada47301c1b232e1d98d59bd11df13274ba76ddd07336b90464010cf4644628  rust-1.98.1-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz
c1dc0f3d12f97a0139ee91010f98002d66927baa210428ea8c68aadcd69bada4  rust-1.98.1-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz
cf1fcf68880d8b2b90128cede7416cfb82ad3584357ce9fb668f2b6244c26e55  rust-std-1.98.1-wasm32-unknown-unknown.tar.xz
